      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Beaber looks like two small wooden huts on stilts, joined high above the ground by a net crawl tunnel. One hut has a pitched roof and a climbing wall with red holds below it. From the decks, green and purple slides come down, including a spiral tube slide and an open spiral slide. Children climb in, crawl across and choose their slide on the way down. Beaber takes 35 to 40 children and covers 32'2\" x 19'5\", with a safe play area of 38'2\" x 25'5\". The hut look suits resorts, farmhouse clubs and society gardens with plenty of trees. The only skill listed for it is positive thinking. Warranty for the galvanised pipe, roto-moulded slides, composite laminates and play rope is 3 years. Ask us for a quote."
     }
